#: processes/content-acquisition.bpmn:13
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "How a resource gets into the graph in the first place. `document-ingestion.bpmn` begins at \"a file lands in uploads/\" and calls that its only entry point — true of ingestion, and silent on how the file got there. This is the step before it. The channels are plural and the set is open: uploads/ is one, the conversation is another."
msgstr ""

